  "benchmark_protocol": "Each observation is one complete first use in a fresh process. Both pay physical kernels/acquisition, the same program-cover compiler for that K, preparation encoding or hull discovery, the shared exact two-amplitude/trailing-D codec, compact decisions, full JSON serialization/parsing, independent program/preparation/decision checking, one informed query at D^h, three same-program threshold pairs (six gate scans: feasibility and feasible identities separately) and answer serialization. All needed NumPy/SciPy imports and first HiGHS initialization occur inside the timed compiler. No previously discovered cover enters either method. Stream uses a depth-first stack and one value row; it is checked by a second full stream, with no full output table or informed list. Worker interpreter startup, common stdlib/project imports, transport and post-task audit measurements are outside both totals. Complete-use wall time includes instrumentation gaps; sum of component medians is reported separately. Methods alternate order by repetition. No reuse trial, resident-memory benefit or universal crossover is inferred.",
